{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209043455c44ea99e5a364424","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create a unique aesthetic direction for Belle Santé. Based on the name (French for \"Beautiful Health\"), I'll create a sophisticated French-inspired aesthetic with a unique color palette:\n\n**Design Direction for Belle Santé:**\n- **Aesthetic**: \"French Garden & Champagne Gold\" - inspired by French formal gardens (like Versailles) with elegant topiary shapes, champagne gold accents, and soft cream backgrounds\n- **Color Palette**: Soft sage greens, champagne gold, cream whites, and charcoal noir accents\n- **Typography**: Elegant French-inspired serif (Playfair Display) paired with modern geometric sans (Outfit)\n- **Animation Shapes**: Topiary/formal garden shapes with elegant symmetry and flowing curves"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b7a4a81-9e9d-4b65-9f8f-743678560845","uuid":"7c21e99f-b1b2-4ec0-8fcc-1d56b090e752"}
